<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1309901210"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1454859116"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="MOTHER"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="lasah"/><amll:meta key="album" value="MOTHER"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:19.190"><div begin="00:17.670" end="04:19.190"><p begin="00:17.670" end="00:22.130" itunes:key="L1">Dear mother, I hope everything's going well<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的母亲 希望您一切安好</span></p><p begin="00:22.130" end="00:26.300" itunes:key="L2">Something tell me that your end is almost near<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有人告诉我 您的终点已近在咫尺</span></p><p begin="00:26.300" end="00:30.930" itunes:key="L3">All flowers have died out, all stars have fallen down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有花儿都已凋零 所有星辰都已坠落</span></p><p begin="00:30.930" end="00:33.000" itunes:key="L4">Only ashes of reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩下回忆的灰烬</span></p><p begin="00:33.000" end="00:35.700" itunes:key="L5">Only ashes of reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只剩下回忆的灰烬</span></p><p begin="00:44.420" end="00:48.930" itunes:key="L6">Dear mother, our new home is a pleasant place<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的母亲 我们的新家是个美好的地方</span></p><p begin="00:48.930" end="00:53.140" itunes:key="L7">Some even call it their second Eden<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有人甚至称它为第二个伊甸园</span></p><p begin="00:53.140" end="00:57.540" itunes:key="L8">But my heart's not here, in shadows they appear<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我的心不在这里，阴影中他们浮现</span></p><p begin="00:57.540" end="00:59.710" itunes:key="L9">As I dream of your reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我梦见你的回忆</span></p><p begin="00:59.710" end="01:02.360" itunes:key="L10">As I dream of your reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我梦见你的回忆</span></p><p begin="01:02.360" end="01:05.580" itunes:key="L11">Lost in the shivering dark<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷失在颤抖的黑暗中</span></p><p begin="01:05.580" end="01:10.660" itunes:key="L12">You're like a tiny teardrop of the universe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就像宇宙中的一滴小泪珠</span></p><p begin="01:10.660" end="01:12.890" itunes:key="L13">I'm still longing for your burning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍然渴望你的燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:12.890" end="01:15.470" itunes:key="L14">Sky and the herd of birds about to fly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空和即将飞翔的鸟群</span></p><p begin="01:15.470" end="01:19.950" itunes:key="L15">Everything, everything, now I know I missed you so much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切一切，现在我知道了</span></p><p begin="01:19.950" end="01:24.480" itunes:key="L16">Won't you laugh at me for being the foolish child I've always been?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如此想念你</span></p><p begin="01:24.480" end="01:30.630" itunes:key="L17">Farewell, farewell, I'm sending this last bouquet to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了，再见了，我将这最后一束花送给你</span></p><p begin="01:46.740" end="01:51.120" itunes:key="L18">Dear mother, I still think of our final day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的母亲，我仍记得我们最后的那一天</span></p><p begin="01:51.120" end="01:55.220" itunes:key="L19">We didn't say much as if time had stopped<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们沉默不语，仿佛时间静止</span></p><p begin="01:55.220" end="01:59.680" itunes:key="L20">With cosmoses in bloom that smelled like strong perfume<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">波斯菊盛开，香气浓郁</span></p><p begin="01:59.680" end="02:01.970" itunes:key="L21">You became a reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已成为回忆</span></p><p begin="02:01.970" end="02:04.540" itunes:key="L22">You became a reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你已成为回忆</span></p><p begin="02:04.540" end="02:07.460" itunes:key="L23">Outside the circle window<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在圆窗外</span></p><p begin="02:07.460" end="02:12.920" itunes:key="L24">I saw your wrinkled lips say, "Take care, good-bye"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见你皱褶的嘴唇说着保重再见</span></p><p begin="02:48.850" end="02:53.540" itunes:key="L25">Your beauty made me close my eyes, and your fragile life I left behind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的美丽让我闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="02:53.540" end="02:57.900" itunes:key="L26">Everything, oh, everything, once I used to hate them so much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切一切曾经</span></p><p begin="02:57.900" end="03:02.360" itunes:key="L27">Now I wish I never said to you those words that I used to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我多希望从未对你说过</span></p><p begin="03:02.360" end="03:06.210" itunes:key="L28">Farewell, farewell, can you hear me, mother?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了，再见了，母亲，您能听到吗</span></p><p begin="03:06.210" end="03:08.070" itunes:key="L29">I'm still longing for your burning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍然渴望你的燃烧</span></p><p begin="03:08.070" end="03:11.030" itunes:key="L30">Sky and the herd of birds about to fly<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天空和即将飞翔的鸟群</span></p><p begin="03:11.030" end="03:15.480" itunes:key="L31">Everything, everything, now I know I missed you so much<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切一切，现在我知道了</span></p><p begin="03:15.480" end="03:20.110" itunes:key="L32">Won't you laugh at me for being the foolish child I've always been?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我如此想念你</span></p><p begin="03:20.110" end="03:24.540" itunes:key="L33">Farewell, farewell, I'm sending this last bouquet to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了，再见了，我送上这</span></p><p begin="03:24.540" end="03:28.520" itunes:key="L34">Why couldn't I say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后一束花给你</span></p><p begin="03:28.520" end="03:33.110" itunes:key="L35">Maybe somewhere I thought I'm coming home one day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我曾以为某天我会回到家中</span></p><p begin="03:33.110" end="03:37.360" itunes:key="L36">Now I need to say goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我不得不说再见</span></p><p begin="03:37.360" end="03:39.460" itunes:key="L37">To become your reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为你的回忆</span></p><p begin="03:39.460" end="03:43.650" itunes:key="L38">To become your reminiscence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为你的回忆</span></p><p begin="03:43.650" end="03:47.720" itunes:key="L39">And one of the stars they shot the living</p><p begin="03:47.720" end="03:52.580" itunes:key="L40">And one of them who showed me loving</p><p begin="03:52.580" end="03:56.930" itunes:key="L41">This song will be the stars for loving</p><p begin="03:56.930" end="04:19.190" itunes:key="L42">When you look at the sky at night</p></div></body></tt>